[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2999753908","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107905#issuecomment-2999753908","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107905","id":2999753908,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6yzJy0","user":{"login":"ze2j","id":46556066,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2NTU2MDY2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46556066?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ze2j","html_url":"https://github.com/ze2j","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ze2j/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ze2j/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ze2j/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ze2j/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ze2j/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ze2j/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ze2j/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ze2j/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ze2j/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-24T10:39:23Z","updated_at":"2025-06-24T10:39:23Z","body":"The error occurred because you need to provide a documentation for the new method. To do this, you can run godot with the `--doctool` argument, fill the updated xml file and then amend your commit.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2999753908/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3001117692","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107905#issuecomment-3001117692","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107905","id":3001117692,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6y4Wv8","user":{"login":"J-Ponzo","id":32590977,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyNTkwOTc3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32590977?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/J-Ponzo","html_url":"https://github.com/J-Ponzo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/J-Ponzo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/J-Ponzo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/J-Ponzo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/J-Ponzo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/J-Ponzo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/J-Ponzo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/J-Ponzo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/J-Ponzo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/J-Ponzo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-24T16:19:24Z","updated_at":"2025-06-24T16:19:24Z","body":"> The error occurred because you need to provide a documentation for the new method. To do this, you can run godot with the `--doctool` argument, fill the updated xml file and then amend your commit.\r\n\r\nThanks for the tip! I ran `--doctool` and it generated `doc/classes/CPUParticles3D.xml` as expected. However, it also generated `doc/classes/ScriptEditor.xml`, even though my PR doesn't touch anything related to it.\r\n\r\nI believe this change came from another PR that was merged into master in the meantime, and got pulled in when I ran `git pull --rebase upstream master` (as recommended).\r\n\r\nShould I include both XML files, or only the one related to my change ?","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3001117692/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3001162870","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107905#issuecomment-3001162870","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107905","id":3001162870,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6y4hx2","user":{"login":"J-Ponzo","id":32590977,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyNTkwOTc3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32590977?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/J-Ponzo","html_url":"https://github.com/J-Ponzo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/J-Ponzo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/J-Ponzo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/J-Ponzo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/J-Ponzo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/J-Ponzo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/J-Ponzo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/J-Ponzo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/J-Ponzo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/J-Ponzo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-24T16:37:24Z","updated_at":"2025-06-24T16:37:24Z","body":"I figured out what happened: I ran `--doctool` on a previous build of Godot, which didn’t include the changes from [#107862](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107862) (`scripteditor-clear-docs-from-script`). That explains the difference in `ScriptEditor.xml`.\r\n\r\nI'm now rebuilding the engine from the latest master and will regenerate the docs. It should be fine then. Thanks again for your help!","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3001162870/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]